! Proposed Definitions And Examples


!! Proposed Definition of ''be''

;__be__ (BE): introduces a sumti to be attached to a selbri which is itself part of a description sumti. By default, it occupies the x2 place of the selbri, but this may be overridden by tags by the same conventions as that of the main bridi.
** Keywords: of.

!! Examples of ''be'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''be'o''

;__be'o__ (BEhO): marks the end of the linked sumti to the current description-internal selbri.
** Keywords: and of.

!! Examples of ''be'o'' Usage
''e'usai klama fa pada .e roda le traji xamgu se tigni be tu'i le plini be'o noi lojbo me la sirkys''
One and everyone should come to the best performance on the planet: the Lojbanic Circus!

!! Proposed Definition of ''bei''

;__bei__ (BEI): introduces an additional sumti to be attached to a selbri which is itself part of a description sumti. By default, each additional linked sumti in succession occupies the next place in the place structure of the selbri. This may be overridden by tags, by the same conventions as that of the main bridi.
** Keywords: end linked sumti.

!! Examples of ''bei'' Usage
''velcli befi la lojban. bei loi co'a cilre''
Introduction to Lojban for beginners

''le plini be le solri ku bei le ka crino''
The planet circling the sun whose characteristic is being green.

! Notes

! Impact
None noted.
